  "claim_boundary": "This is a one-seed, 5-fold pair-atomic method-development experiment on 77 audited Open Images pairs. It may show that a frozen 49-token VLM can learn to route posture evidence, and estimate whether region supervision helps an equal-capacity readout. It cannot establish broad multimodal quality, causal counterfactual reasoning, global novelty, benchmark superiority, or readiness of a released model. The marked-view primary task assumes an external target box; full-image and crop transfer are secondary. A separate, newly acquired and sealed confirmation set is required before any confirmatory claim."
